  "limits": [
    "WorldCommand has no region field, so the report payload carries entity id, observed revision and recipient team. The region shown is the server-created TeamReport.RegionId, which the test checks equals the observed entity region. Adding a client-asserted region would need an AuthoritativeShift/WorldContracts change outside this issue's write scope.",
    "The PlayMode tests call the real AuthoritativeShift and round-trip commands, receipts and projected views through JsonUtility, but no NGO transport, NetworkManager or second process runs. Two-process authority is the #27 input, not re-proven here.",
    "Headless batchmode does not paint OnGUI (it returns early under Application.isBatchMode). Render evidence is FieldCommandPanel.RenderLines, the same strings DrawCommandPanel lays out; no screenshot or interactive run was made.",
    "Server commands require active input (InputEnabled), and releasing the cursor to click IMGUI buttons disables input. Panel actions are therefore keys while controls are active: E report/claim nearest, R acknowledge oldest unacknowledged report, H hand off the led evacuee.",
    "FieldView carries no teammate roster, so the hand-off recipient is a typed participant id (editable while controls are paused). The server validates the recipient.",
    "Evacuee rows and reportable incidents are limited to entities in the participant's projected view (interest radius, visibility, discovered incidents); team reports follow the server's 16-report window.",
    "PlayMode runs rewrote 16 generated FoundationDemo materials (_EMISSION keyword) in the isolated worktree; they are not part of this change.",
    "EditMode regression run has 2 failures that also fail at the unmodified base runtime (attempt 06). The 4 skipped PlayMode tests are Explicit voice integration tests."
  ],
